I can't really explain it.

696
00:56:54,705 --> 00:56:57,105
So… I don't have that?

697
00:56:57,185 --> 00:57:00,625
No. You don't have that spark
when you draw.

698
00:57:00,705 --> 00:57:02,385
But I've seen it in you before.

699
00:57:06,305 --> 00:57:07,345
Here.

700
00:57:08,425 --> 00:57:10,385
