than you are now.

701
00:57:13,105 --> 00:57:14,505
When did you see this?

702
00:57:14,585 --> 00:57:15,985
A while ago.

703
00:57:16,065 --> 00:57:17,665
It popped up in my feed.

704
00:57:17,745 --> 00:57:19,625
I guess I've been watching
a lot of game streams.

705
00:57:21,745 --> 00:57:23,585
Did you study architecture
for your family?

706
00:57:28,705 --> 00:57:31,785
Here's my advice.
Why don't you talk to them first?

707
00:57:32,585 --> 00:57:36,425
Trust me. I've been through it.
And this is how it turned out.

708
00:57:37,425 --> 00:57:39,385
I studied something I didn't like.

709
00:57:40,065 --> 00:57:43,305
When I finally started working,
I was miserable.

710
00:57:44,305 --> 00:57:46,345
I thought you liked architecture.

711
00:57:46,425 --> 00:57:48,345
That's why you started teaching it.

712
00:57:49,665 --> 00:57:53,025
I don't like architecture.
I just like educating people.

713
00:57:54,705 --> 00:57:58,185
Honestly, I don't really have
anything to teach anyone, except this.

714
00:57:58,985 --> 00:58:03,905
It took me until I was almost 30
to find my own balance, Putter.

715
00:58:05,065 --> 00:58:07,465
Your time belongs to you.

716
00:58:08,025 --> 00:58:10,985
Don't let it slip away. It's too precious.

717
00:58:12,665 --> 00:58:15,105
At the very least,
I hope you'll try talking to them first.

718
00:58:15,185 --> 00:58:17,185
I'm sure you can find a way together.

719
00:58:17,265 --> 00:58:18,745
Thank you so much.

720
00:58:25,465 --> 00:58:26,985
I've already lit the spark for you.

721
00:58:27,665 --> 00:58:29,225
Now you need to keep the fire going.

722
00:58:29,865 --> 00:58:32,585
Don't let it burn out, your passion.

723
00:58:33,185 --> 00:58:35,265
Go on. Head home.

724
00:58:43,705 --> 00:58:45,905
DON'T GIVE UP EVEN WHEN IT'S HARD! - REBEL

725
00:58:58,305 --> 00:58:59,785
Yeah, okay.

726
00:59:09,905 --> 00:59:10,785
Lee!

727
