I don't want to lie on
the couch while I'm all dirty.

730
00:59:37,625 --> 00:59:39,985
Don't worry about it.
See? I'm already lying down. Come here.

731
00:59:40,065 --> 00:59:42,985
-Hey, no way.
-Come on. Get over here.

732
00:59:46,305 --> 00:59:47,225
How is it?

733
