Your mom's couch is so nice.

734
00:59:49,425 --> 00:59:50,665
It really is comfortable.

735
00:59:51,785 --> 00:59:56,345
Your time belongs to you.

736
00:59:56,425 --> 00:59:57,785
Don't let it slip away.

737
00:59:57,865 --> 01:00:00,705
At the very least,
I hope you'll try talking to them first.

738
01:00:00,785 --> 01:00:02,425
I'm sure you can find a way together.

739
01:00:12,505 --> 01:00:15,185
How should I start talking
to my parents about my dream?

740
01:00:17,145 --> 01:00:19,145
Opening up about your dreams

741
01:00:19,225 --> 01:00:22,385
or your goals in life with your parents
may feel awkward or intimidating at first.

742
01:00:22,465 --> 01:00:25,145
But if you prepare yourself
and choose the right moment,

743
01:00:25,225 --> 01:00:26,825
everything will go much more smoothly.

744
01:00:26,905 --> 01:00:29,225
Try these tips and steps.

745
01:00:33,065 --> 01:00:35,265
So how do I start moving on?

746
01:00:36,665 --> 01:00:40,225
Answer me like
you're a relationship expert.

747
01:00:41,905 --> 01:00:43,225
An expired love

748
01:00:43,305 --> 01:00:45,985
is like a pair of shoes
that rubs your feet raw.

749
01:00:46,065 --> 01:00:49,145
No matter how beautiful they are,
or how much they cost,

750
01:00:49,225 --> 01:00:52,545
if you keep wearing them,
the wound will never heal.

751
01:00:52,625 --> 01:00:57,345
Try taking them off
and find a new pair that fits you better.

752
01:00:57,425 --> 01:00:59,945
Is there anything else
you'd like to tell me?

753
01:01:00,025 --> 01:01:02,345
What's weighing on your mind the most?

754
01:01:04,505 --> 01:01:07,745
FIRST DAY OF SCHOOL BREAK

755
01:01:11,545 --> 01:01:13,465
I'm going back home for a while.

756
01:01:14,345 --> 01:01:16,225
