Dad, Mom.

782
01:07:07,385 --> 01:07:09,465
I don't want to
continue studying architecture.

783
01:07:09,985 --> 01:07:11,545
Let's break up.

784
01:07:11,625 --> 01:07:13,385
You act just like your friend.

785
01:07:14,585 --> 01:07:16,265
New opportunities
are right around the corner.

786
01:07:17,345 --> 01:07:19,105
You don't have to
force yourself if you don't like it.

787
01:07:19,705 --> 01:07:20,905
If we force this, it'll destroy all of us.

788
01:07:23,585 --> 01:07:26,105
Tungtae. Are you with Putter?

789
01:07:26,185 --> 01:07:27,585
What? He isn't coming back?

790
01:07:29,385 --> 01:07:30,625
I honestly can't just be your friend.

